<title>SPAIN: Thomson Bankwatch rates Argentaria &quot;AA&quot;.</title>
<headline>Thomson Bankwatch rates Argentaria &quot;AA&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Corporacion Bancaria de Espana (Argentaria) said on Tuesday Thomson Bankwatch had assigned it an &quot;AA&quot; credit rating.</p>
<p>The rating agency cited the high quality of the bank's assets, cost controls and improvement in operating capacity, Argentaria said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2160</p>
</text>
